(7) For the purposes of paragraph Dl of section V of the CRS, a reporting financial institution shall complete its review of all pre-existing entity accounts with an aggregate account balance or value that exceeds USD250,OOO as of 3 1st December 201 6 by 3 1st December 20 18.

